Debugging & Logs in GitHub Actions

Today I learned how logs and debugging tools help identify and fix workflow failures quickly.

🔹 Workflow Logs
Workflow logs show:
Job execution details
Step-by-step output
Errors and warnings
Logs are the first place to troubleshoot issues.

🔹 Debug Mode
Debug mode:
Provides detailed execution info
Shows expanded logs
Helps trace environment values
It simplifies root cause analysis.

🔹 Common Failures
Common causes include:
Incorrect secrets
YAML syntax errors
Permission issues
Understanding failures reduces downtime.

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
Logs reveal issues.
 Debugging adds clarity.
 Failures improve learning.
